      "statement": "m173 has a ratio-dependent V2 maximum near 1/1. With 1,500 ul DCM, V2 is 31.91, 78.37, and 46.22 ml at 0/1, 1/1, and 2/1; with 2,000 ul it is 50.30, 108.89, and 60.92 ml at 0/1, 1/1, and 5/1. At 5/1, the 1,500 and 2,000 ul values are nearly identical, 61.87 and 60.92 ml. The plug effect therefore depends strongly on ratio; density also changes slightly, so this is an approximate plug contrast."
