      "basis": "observed_measured",
      "statement": "m92 repeatability competes with the apparent loading effect. The two 20/1, 100 ul, EA measurements give V2 29.63 and 33.32 ml, while the 50 ul value is 34.55 ml. The direction of the small 50-versus-100 ul contrast is therefore not secure."
